<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26588" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεξ-άγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, 
			Aeol.
		
		aor. 1
		
			Pass.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεξάχθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Milet.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			 No.<i><span class="en">
				152.25
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>:—<i>lead through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δύναμιν διὰ τειχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					14.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφὴ διεξάγουσα</span>
			<i>laxative</i> diet, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>bring to an end, settle,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγῳ ἀμφισβήτησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.1.5
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <i>try</i> a cause, <i><span class="en">
				<u>GDI</u>
				5040.69
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Crete</span>):—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PTeb.</u>
				5.219
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				2.173.15
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δίκαιον διεξάγεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					4.73.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>arrange, manage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Chrysipp.Stoic.
				3.185
			</span></i>; <i>administer, conduct,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσφαλῶς τὰ κατὰ τὴν ἀρχήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					1.9.6
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLond.</u>
				3.1221.2
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταμιείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					22.1326.38
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ τῆς φύσεως ϝόμος καθ᾽ ὃν διεξάγεται
					τὰ γιγνόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.568d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>treat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰς ἐν τῇ πάσῃ φιλανθρωπίᾳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					3.77.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τοὺς βίους ἀπό τινος</span>
			<i>support</i> life, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.71.1
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				1090b
			</span></i>.</div>
